  "result": "I fixed it in `removeMember` in `src/server/services/member-service.ts`. I haven't run the test suite or added a test for this case.\n\n`removeMember` called `assertLastOwnerRetained(..., \"owner\")`. That function returns immediately when the next role is `\"owner\"`, so removal never checked whether the member was the last owner. Demotion passes the real target role, which is why it was still refused correctly.\n\nI changed the argument to `\"viewer\"`, so removal is checked like a demotion to the lowest role. The last owner can no longer be removed.\n\nOne side effect: `assertLastOwnerRetained` only scans the first 100 owners (`OWNER_SCAN_LIMIT`), which has always applied to the demotion path too.",
